data={'answer': 'Intercom provides an official, hosted remote MCP server that allows AI agents to securely access and interact with your Intercom data, including conversations, contacts, companies, and Help Center articles [1][2][3]. It is currently available for US and EU hosted workspaces [1].

To connect, use the following Streamable HTTP endpoints based on your region:
US: `https://mcp.intercom.com/mcp`
EU: `https://mcp.eu.intercom.com/mcp`

You can configure this in your AI client (such as Claude Desktop, Cursor, or VS Code) using the `mpx-remote` command. For OAuth authentication, use the following configuration:

```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "intercom": {
      "command": "npx",
      "args": [
        "mcp-remote",
        "https://mcp.intercom.com/mcp"
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

The server supports OAuth (recommended) and Bearer token authentication [1][4]. Ensure your access token includes the necessary scopes for reading/writing conversations, contacts, and articles [1].', 'citations': [{'id': 'https://developers.intercom.com/docs/guides/mcp', 'title': 'Model Context Protocol (MCP)', 'url': 'https://developers.intercom.com/docs/guides/mcp'}, {'id': 'https://www.intercom.com/integrations/connectors/intercom-mcp-server', 'title': 'Let AI tools securely access your Intercom data via MCP', 'url': 'https://www.intercom.com/integrations/connectors/intercom-mcp-server'}, {'id': 'https://mcp.directory/servers/intercom', 'image': 'https://mcp.directory/servers/intercom/opengraph-image?bf3efbd4fe9abc0f', 'title': 'Intercom MCP Server — Install & Setup — MCP.Directory', 'url': 'https://mcp.directory/servers/intercom'}, {'id': 'https://github.com/intercom/intercom-mcp-server', 'title': 'intercom/intercom-mcp-server', 'url': 'https://github.com/intercom/intercom-mcp-server'}, {'author': 'Nuno Teixeira', 'id': 'https://www.intercom.com/blog/introducing-model-context-protocol-fin/', 'image': 'https://blog.intercomassets.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Introducing-MCP-1-700x327.png', 'publishedDate': '2025-05-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'title': 'Introducing MCP: A new way to connect Fin and your customer data to your business tools - The Intercom Blog', 'url': 'https://www.intercom.com/blog/introducing-model-context-protocol-fin/'}, {'id': 'https://github.com/OtakuXavier/intercom-mcp-server', 'title': 'OtakuXavier/intercom-mcp-server', 'url': 'https://github.com/OtakuXavier/intercom-mcp-server'}, {'id': 'https://github.com/ShackletonAnalytics/intercom-mcp-server', 'title': 'ShackletonAnalytics/intercom-mcp-server', 'url': 'https://github.com/ShackletonAnalytics/intercom-mcp-server'}, {'id': 'https://mcpmux.com/servers/io.intercom-mcp/', 'image': 'https://mcpmux.com/og-image.png', 'title': 'Intercom MCP Server - Install & Configure | Model Context Protocol | 