data={'answer': 'The Klaviyo Model Context Protocol (MCP) server is an official tool that creates a secure bridge between your Klaviyo account and AI assistants like Claude, ChatGPT, Cursor, and VS Code. It allows you to query your data, generate reports, and perform marketing actions using natural language.

You can connect via two methods:

Remote-hosted (recommended): Use the URL https://mcp.klaviyo.com/mcp. This supports OAuth authentication and is ideal for web-based AI clients.

Local-hosted: Run the server locally using uvx. This requires a Klaviyo Private API Key and is configured via your client's settings file:

```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "klaviyo": {
      "command": "uvx",
      "args": ["klaviyo-mcp-server@latest"],
      "env": {
        "PRIVATE_API_KEY": "YOUR_API_KEY",
        "READ_ONLY": "false",
        "ALLOW_USER_GENERATED_CONTENT": "true"
      }
    }
  }
}
```

You can restrict permissions by setting READ_ONLY to true to disable write actions.', 'citations': [{'id': 'https://developers.klaviyo.com/en/v2026-01-15/docs/klaviyo_mcp_server', 'title': '', 'url': 'https://developers.klaviyo.com/en/v2026-01-15/docs/klaviyo_mcp_server'}, {'id': 'https://pypi.org/project/klaviyo-mcp-server/', 'title': 'klaviyo-mcp-server v0.4.1', 'url': 'https://pypi.org/project/klaviyo-mcp-server/'}, {'id': 'https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/52833598880923', 'image': 'https://help.klaviyo.com/opengraph-image.jpg', 'title': 'Klaviyo MCP Server Guide For Agencies  | Klaviyo Help Center', 'url': 'https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/52833598880923'}, {'id': 'https://developers.klaviyo.com/en/v2025-10-15/docs/klaviyo_mcp_server', 'title': '', 'url': 'https://developers.klaviyo.com/en/v2025-10-15/docs/klaviyo_mcp_server'}, {'favicon': 'https://www.klaviyo.com/icons/icon-32x32.png', 'id': 'https://www.klaviyo.com/newsroom/mcp-server', 'image': 'https://www.klaviyo.com/static/klaviyo-social-share-image.jpg', 'title': 'Klaviyo MCP Server Helps Marketers Move Faster with AI - Klaviyo', 'url': 'https://www.klaviyo.com/newsroom/mcp-server'}, {'favicon': 'https://files.readme.io/545519e-small-favicon.png', 'id': 'https://developers.klaviyo.com/en/v2025-04-15/docs/klaviyo_mcp_server', 'image': 'https://drive.google.com/uc?id=1fYaJzHObD87SrY9EzKesI4klynB3D9ep', 'title': '(Beta) Klaviyo MCP server', 'url': 'https://developers.klaviyo.com/en/v2025-04-15/docs/klaviyo_mcp_server'}, {'id': 'https://www.klaviyo.com/blog/introducing-mcp-server', 'image': 'https://cdn.sanity.io/images/6ct6b26e/marketing-prod/ad429e4cf918788ddd92f976e9e6574ac6faf02a-766x512.webp?rect=0,55,766,402&w=1200&h=630&fm=jpg', 'publishedDate': '2025-09-25T00:00:00.000Z', 'title': 'Klaviyo MCP Server: AI-powered Analytics Insights and Marketing Actions with Customer Data - Klaviyo', 'url': 'https://www.klaviyo.com/blog/introducing-mcp-server'}, {'id': 'https://www.klaviyo.com/blog/