data={'answer': 'The DataForSEO MCP server is an official open-source implementation of the Model Context Protocol that allows AI assistants like Claude, Cursor, and ChatGPT to interact with seven DataForSEO APIs, including SERP, Keywords, and Backlinks. It acts as a bridge, enabling you to retrieve SEO data using natural language prompts without writing code.

You can connect via a local npx command or a remote HTTP endpoint. To use it locally, add this configuration to your MCP client:

```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "dataforseo": {
      "command": "npx",
      "args": ["-y", "dataforseo-mcp-server"],
      "env": {
        "DATAFORSEO_USERNAME": "your_api_login",
        "DATAFORSEO_PASSWORD": "your_api_password"
      }
    }
  }
}
```

Alternatively, you can connect to the remote endpoint at https://mcp.dataforseo.com/v3/mcp using Basic Auth or OAuth [1][2][3]. The project is maintained on GitHub at dataforseo/mcp-server-typescript [4].', 'citations': [{'id': 'https://dataforseo.com/seo-mcp-server', 'image': 'https://dataforseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/09-seo-mcp-server.png', 'title': 'SEO MCP Server — Real SEO Data for Claude, Cursor & AI Agents – DataForSEO', 'url': 'https://dataforseo.com/seo-mcp-server'}, {'id': 'https://dataforseo.com/model-context-protocol', 'image': 'https://dataforseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/ukr-logo_429.png', 'publishedDate': '2025-05-21T00:00:00.000Z', 'title': 'DataForSEO Model Context Protocol – DataForSEO', 'url': 'https://dataforseo.com/model-context-protocol'}, {'id': 'https://dataforseo.com/help-center/connecting-the-remote-dataforseo-mcp-server-using-oauth', 'image': 'https://dataforseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Claude-1-1500x942.png', 'title': 'Connecting the remote DataForSEO MCP server using OAuth – DataForSEO', 'url': 'https://dataforseo.com/help-center/connecting-the-remote-dataforseo-mcp-server-using-oauth'}, {'author': 'dataforseo', 'id': 'https://github.com/dataforseo/mcp-server-typescript', 'image': 'https://opengraph.githubassets.com/6a615c51908062c98b15716fd99e9e5756b052fdb553d2fb09efc2c1e72d26de/dataforseo/mcp-server-typescript', 'publishedDate': '2025-04-10T00:00:00.000Z', 'title': 'GitHub - dataforseo/mcp-server-typescript: DataForSEO API modelcontextprotocol server · GitHub', 'url': 'https://github.com/dataforseo/mcp-server-typescript'}, {'id': 'https://dataforseo.com/help-center/setting-up-the-official-dataforseo-mcp-server-simple-guide', 'image': 'https://dataforseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/ukr-logo_429.png', 'publishedDate': '2025-05-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'title': 'Setting Up the Official DataForSEO MCP Server: Simple Guide – DataForSEO', 'url': 'https://dataforseo.com/help-center/setting-up-the-official-dataforseo-mcp-server