data={'answer': 'Notion provides an official, hosted remote MCP server that enables AI tools to read and write to your Notion workspace using OAuth [1][2]. This is the recommended solution for most users, as it is actively maintained, requires no infrastructure, and is optimized for AI agents [1][3].

