data={'answer': 'The official Xero MCP server is an open-source bridge that allows LLMs to interact with Xero’s accounting and business APIs [1][2]. It is maintained by Xero and available as the npm package @xeroapi/xero-mcp-server [3][4].

To integrate it with an MCP client like Claude Desktop, add the following to your configuration file [1][5]:

```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "xero": {
      "command": "npx",
      "args": ["-y", "@xeroapi/xero-mcp-server@latest"],
      "env": {
        "XERO_CLIENT_ID": "your_client_id_here",
        "XERO_CLIENT_SECRET": "your_client_secret_here",
        "XERO_SCOPES": "accounting.invoices accounting.contacts accounting.settings"
      }
    }
  }
}
```

The server supports OAuth2 via custom connections for machine-to-machine access or bearer tokens for runtime authentication [6][4]. It requires Node.js v18 or higher [1][3].', 'citations': [{'id': 'https://github.com/XeroAPI/xero-mcp-server/', 'title': 'XeroAPI/xero-mcp-server', 'url': 'https://github.com/XeroAPI/xero-mcp-server/'}, {'author': 'Regan Ashworth', 'favicon': 'https://miro.medium.com/v2/5d8de952517e8160e40ef9841c781cdc14a5db313057fa3c3de41c6f5b494b19', 'id': 'https://devblog.xero.com/xero-introduces-new-model-context-protocol-server-for-smarter-accounting-4d195ccaeda5', 'image': 'https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:1000/1*zd8RWV7ONlVGX-1ex9WSww.png', 'publishedDate': '2025-03-26T20:45:39.000Z', 'title': 'Medium', 'url': 'https://devblog.xero.com/xero-introduces-new-model-context-protocol-server-for-smarter-accounting-4d195ccaeda5'}, {'id': 'https://www.npmjs.com/package/@xeroapi/xero-mcp-server', 'title': '@xeroapi/xero-mcp-server', 'url': 'https://www.npmjs.com/package/@xeroapi/xero-mcp-server'}, {'id': 'https://onei.ai/mcps/xero-mcp-server', 'image': 'https://unavatar.io/github/XeroAPI', 'title': 'Xero MCP Server | Onei AI', 'url': 'https://onei.ai/mcps/xero-mcp-server'}, {'id': 'https://glama.ai/mcp/servers/XeroAPI/xero-mcp-server', 'image': 'https://glama.ai/mcp/servers/XeroAPI/xero-mcp-server/og-image', 'title': 'Xero MCP Server by XeroAPI | Glama', 'url': 'https://glama.ai/mcp/servers/XeroAPI/xero-mcp-server'}, {'id': 'https://github.com/xeroapi/xero-mcp-server/blob/main/README.md', 'title': 'README.md', 'url': 'https://github.com/xeroapi/xero-mcp-server/blob/main/README.md'}, {'author': 'Kipper Inc.', 'id': 'https://kipper.com/blog/setup-xero-mcp/', 'image': 'https://kipper.com/images/og/blog/setup-xero-mcp.png', 'publishedDate': '2026-07-16T00:00:00.000Z', 'title': 'How to Set Up Xero MCP Server (Developer Guide) | Kipper', 'url': 'https://kipper.com/blog/setup-xero-mcp/'}, {'id': 'https://registry.npmjs.org/@xeroapi/xero-mcp-server/-/xero-mcp