data={'answer': 'Grain provides an official Model Context Protocol (MCP) server that allows AI assistants to access your meeting recordings, transcripts, AI notes, and workspace data [1][2]. It is a hosted, remote service available at the endpoint https://api.grain.com/_/mcp [3][2].

To connect, add this URL to any MCP-compatible client like Claude Desktop, Cursor, or ChatGPT [1][3]. Authentication is handled via an OAuth 2.1 flow that triggers in your browser upon the first connection [4][5][2].

For clients requiring a command-based configuration, use the following:

```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "grain": {
      "command": "npx",
      "args": ["-y", "mcp-remote", "https://api.grain.com/_/mcp"]
    }
  }
}
```

The server supports granular scopes (`mcp:read`, `mcp:query`, `mcp:investigate`) to control data access [4][5]. You can manage or revoke these connections at any time via your Grain workspace settings under Connectors [5].', 'citations': [{'id': 'https://support.grain.com/en/articles/14811968-grain-mcp', 'image': 'https://intercom.help/usegrain/assets/favicon', 'publishedDate': '2026-07-06T20:04:40.000Z', 'title': 'Grain MCP | Grain', 'url': 'https://support.grain.com/en/articles/14811968-grain-mcp'}, {'id': 'https://growthengineer.ai/mcp-servers/grain', 'title': 'Grain MCP Server - Setup, Use Cases & Examples', 'url': 'https://growthengineer.ai/mcp-servers/grain'}, {'id': 'https://mcpservers.org/remote-mcp-servers/grain', 'title': '', 'url': 'https://mcpservers.org/remote-mcp-servers/grain'}, {'id': 'https://docs.grainql.com/ai-tools/mcp/overview', 'title': '', 'url': 'https://docs.grainql.com/ai-tools/mcp/overview'}, {'id': 'https://docs.grainql.com/ai-tools/mcp/security', 'title': '', 'url': 'https://docs.grainql.com/ai-tools/mcp/security'}, {'id': 'https://grain.com/release-note/06-18-2025', 'publishedDate': '2025-06-18T00:00:00.000Z', 'title': 'Grain', 'url': 'https://grain.com/release-note/06-18-2025'}, {'id': 'https://docs.grainql.com/ai-tools/mcp/tools', 'title': '', 'url': 'https://docs.grainql.com/ai-tools/mcp/tools'}, {'id': 'https://github.com/eadm/grain-mcp-server', 'title': 'eadm/grain-mcp-server', 'url': 'https://github.com/eadm/grain-mcp-server'}]} error=None log_id='log_GShQRK8S3ayT'
